   "subject": "Rights management in ShinyApps.io professional",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Hi,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">We have ShinyApps.io professional and want other users besides the account\r\nmembers to be able to deploy and modify their own apps. The solution we have tried\r\nso far is to create a token for each individual user. But, a problem has arisen,\r\nit seems to be possible to modify <u>all</u> apps in the account via rsconnect once\r\nyou have got a token, not just the ones tied to a specific token. Is this correct? Do you have any other\r\nsuggestion how to solve this?<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><u></u>Thanks,<u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Fredrik<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "HL9XDsfoBgAJ",
   "from": "Andy Kipp",
   "author": "e84e7628b5f8a3e1",
   "date": "2018-02-20T15:41:50Z",
   "subject": "Re: [shinyapps-users] Rights management in ShinyApps.io professional",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>Fredrik, <br><br>You are correct. <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360147319000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1BMApANJxH-CaO5-Q4sb0s\">shinyapps.io</a> does not support any type of account roles, therefore anyone with access to the account has access to all the applications in that account.<br><br></div>I&#39;m afraid I don&#39;t have any great ideas for a workaround at this time, as this is how the system is designed to work.<br><br></div>-Andy<br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
